\refdeft{Supervised fine-tuning in InstructGPT}{Section 3.5 and Appendix C.1}{ouyang2022training}{
\p{In the cited pipeline, \newvocab{supervised fine-tuning} (SFT) starts from a
pretrained GPT-3 checkpoint and updates it by supervised learning on labeler
demonstrations. The resulting policy supplies the starting and reference
policy for later stages.}

\p{Appendix C.1 reports optimization choices for that construction. It does
not define a universal mask, weighting rule, or fine-tuning protocol.}
}

